      LessonBlock.example("Aik phal wale ne 40 kilo aam 50 rupay kilo ke hisaab se khareede. 10 kilo kharab ho gaye. Baqi 30 kilo us ne 80 rupay kilo beche. Natija kya hua?", note: "Lagat barabar 40 guna 50 barabar 2000. Farokht barabar 30 guna 80 barabar 2400. Nafa barabar 400, feesad 400 taqseem 2000 guna 100 barabar 20. Jawab 20 feesad nafa. Kharab hisse ki lagat bhi tumhari hi jeb se gayi thi, is liye lagat pure 40 kilo ki ginni."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Ye kahan kaam aata hai"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Roz marra me ye hisaab har dukaan, har sale aur har online offer me chhupa hota hai. Jab board par 50 feesad off likha dekho to ab tum jante ho ke ye likhi qeemat par hai, aur asal sawal ye hai ke likhi qeemat barhai to nahi gayi thi. Paper me is ki teen shaklain sab se zyada ati hain. Aik seedhi lagat farokht wali. Dusri discount ke sath uljhi hui. Teesri do cheezon wali, jisme nafa nuqsan brabar lagta hai lekin hota nahi. Ab paper wale andaaz ke do sawal dekho."),
      LessonBlock.example("A shopkeeper buys an article for 750 rupees and sells it for 900 rupees. Find his profit percent. Nafa 150, lagat par nikalo, 150 taqseem 750 guna 100 barabar 20 feesad."),
      LessonBlock.example("An article is sold at 10 percent loss for 720 rupees. What was its cost price? Farokht lagat ka 90 feesad hai, lagat barabar 720 taqseem 0.90 barabar 800."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Yaad rakhne ki trick"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Is topic ki trick aik sawal hai jo tum har sawal me pehle khud se poochho ge: feesad kis par nikal raha hai? Jawab hamesha tay hai. Nafa nuqsan ho to lagat par. Discount ho to likhi qeemat par. Bas ye aik sawal aadhi ghaltiyan wahi rok dega jahan hoti hain."),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aur dusri chaal, 100 wali chaal. Jab number baray aur ajeeb hon to zehen me lagat ko 100 maan lo. 100 lagaye, 20 feesad nafa yani 120 me biki. Ab tanasub se asal number par ajayo. Baray numberon ka dar khatam ho jata hai aur hisaab chhota ho jata hai. Aik aur nishani yaad rakho: jahan do cheezain aik hi qeemat par biki dikhen aur nafa nuqsan ke feesad brabar hon, wahan jawab hamesha nuqsan hota hai. Gin ne ki zaroorat nahi, pehchan hi kaafi hai."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Paper ki aam ghaltiyan"),
      LessonBlock.paragraph("Ab wo ghaltiyan dekho jin par students number kaatte hain. Main ghalat tareeqa aur sahi tareeqa sath sath likh raha hun."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Lagat 100, farokht 120, nafa 20 hai. Men ne nafa feesad farokht par nikal kar 16.67 feesad likh diya.", "Nafa 20 feesad hai.", "Nafa hamesha lagat par nikalta hai. 20 taqseem 100 guna 100 barabar 20. Farokht par nikalna is topic ki sab se aam ghalti hai."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Discount lagat par nikal liya.", "Discount hamesha likhi hui qeemat par nikalta hai.", "Discount grahak ko dikhayi gayi qeemat par milta hai, dukandaar ki lagat se grahak ko koi matlab nahi. Dono ke adday alag hain, inhen milana sawal ko bigaar deta hai."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Do cheezain aik qeemat par bechín, aik par 20 feesad nafa aur dusri par 20 feesad nuqsan, to na nafa hua na nuqsan.", "Hamesha nuqsan hota hai.", "Nuqsan wali cheez ki lagat zyada hoti hai aur nafe wali ki kam. Feesad brabar hon tab bhi raqam brabar nahi hoti. Upar wali misaal me 50 rupay ka nuqsan gin kar dikhaya gaya tha."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Cycle 1200 me li, 200 marammat ke lagaye, 1540 me bechi, aur nafa 1540 manfi 1200 barabar 340 gin liya.", "Nafa 140 hai.", "Marammat aur le jane ka kharcha bhi lagat me shamil hota hai. Asal lagat 1400 hai. Jo paisa cheez ko bechne ke qabil banane me laga, wo lagat hai."),
      LessonBlock.trap("Nuqsan feesad farokht par nikal liya ke chalo nafa lagat par tha to nuqsan farokht par hoga.", "Nuqsan feesad bhi lagat par hi nikalta hai.", "Dono ka adda aik hi hai, lagat. Nafa ho ya nuqsan, naap hamesha us raqam se hoti hai jo pehle lagi thi."),
