      LessonBlock.example("Aik rectangle plot 25 metre lamba aur 15 metre chora hai. Us ke gird baarh lagani hai. Baarh kitni lambi hogi?", note: "Hal zehen me karo. Baarh perimeter hai, 2 × (25 + 15) = 2 × 40 = 80 metre. Options me 375 bhi hoga, jo area hai. Wahi paper ka phanda hai."),
      LessonBlock.example("Aik gol mez ka radius 14 centimetre hai. Us ke kinare par lace lagani hai. Lace kitni lagegi?", note: "Lace kinare par lagegi, yani circumference. 2 × 22/7 × 14 = 88 centimetre."),
      LessonBlock.heading("Yaad rakhne ki trick"),
