      LessonBlock.paragraph("Aur do chhoti lines aur bandh lo. Triangle dikhe to aadha kabhi na bhoolo. Aur circle dikhe to pehla qadam hamesha radius hai, diameter diya ho to use aadha karna hi pehla kaam hai."),
